cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Kibbo Healthcare Cost Dataset (2026) — Reduced Deposit"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-20"
abstract: >-
  A reduced-scope, openly redistributable subset of Kibbo's 58-row
  comparison of the real cost of getting sick in the United States,
  United Kingdom, Germany, and Spain. Rows sourced from government
  data, statutory rates, and Kibbo's own facts are kept in full;
  rows sourced from publishers whose own terms do not permit open
  redistribution (KFF, The King's Fund, BMJ, MyCareCost, iFHP/HCCI,
  Merritt Hawkins) are kept with their citation and source URL but
  their value withheld. See README.md for the full breakdown.
authors:
  - name: "Kibbo Research"
    website: "https://www.getkibbo.com"
